# Local dev defaults (mode=development). Header-trust path — no Keycloak needed.
# The console sends X-Company-Id / X-Actor that the services' DevTenantFilter reads, and Vite
# proxies /api/** per-path to org/finance/restaurant (see vite.config.ts).
#
# To exercise the REAL auth path locally instead, run with overrides, e.g.:
#   VITE_AUTH_MODE=oidc VITE_KEYCLOAK_URL=http://localhost:18080 VITE_GATEWAY_URL=http://localhost:8090 npm run dev
VITE_AUTH_MODE=dev
